          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Only if the water is coming from your plumbing. It closes the incoming supply, which is highly effective against a burst line or a failed washing machine hose. It has no effect whatsoever on groundwater from a failed sump pump or seepage through the cove joint, which is the kind of flooding most people with basements actually worry about."
          }
